functions/
# Ignore tools/ contents via tools/* (NOT tools/) so git still descends into tools/
# and the negation below can re-include the App Store screenshot tool. A blanket
# tools/ excludes the dir itself, blocking any re-include of paths beneath it.
tools/*
# Track the whole App Store screenshot tool so the ASO slide set is reproducible from
# the repo, with no add-friction on its tracked source. The tool's own
# tools/appstore-screenshots/.gitignore already excludes node_modules/, dist/,
# test/out/, and templates/.tmp-*. Re-ignore only the generated artifacts it doesn't
# cover: the redundant .jpeg capture exports and the test-bootstrapped placeholder.
!tools/appstore-screenshots/
tools/appstore-screenshots/captures/*.jpeg
tools/appstore-screenshots/test/fixtures/placeholder-capture.png

nul
